                <invention-title lang="de">VORWÄRTSFEHLERKORREKTUR UND ZYKLISCHE REDUNDANZPRÜFUNGSMECHANISMEN FÜR LATENZKRITISCHE KOHÄRENZ- UND SPEICHERVERBINDUNGEN</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">MÉCANISMES DE CORRECTION D'ERREURS SANS VOIE DE RETOUR ET DE CONTRÔLE DE REDONDANCE CYCLIQUE POUR COHÉRENCE CRITIQUE DE LATENCE ET INTERCONNEXIONS DE MÉMOIRE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">FORWARD ERROR CORRECTION AND CYCLIC REDUNDANCY CHECK MECHANISMS FOR LATENCY-CRITICAL COHERENCY AND MEMORY INTERCONNECTS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Provided are forward error correction and cyclic redundancy check mechanisms for latency-critical coherency and memory interconnects. For example, an apparatus comprises protocol stack circuitry and a port. The protocol stack circuitry is to encode first information into a first portion of a flow control unit (Flit), determine first cyclic redundancy check (CRC) code for the first information, encode the first CRC code into the first portion of the Flit, encode second information into a second portion of the Flit, determine second CRC code for the second information, and encode the second CRC code into the second portion of the Flit. The port is to transmit the first portion of the Flit and the second portion of the Flit on a link. The link comprising multiple physical lanes.</p>
            </abstract>
